    },
    {
      "claim": "The overall market size or demand for an AI Tutor for MBA students in the United States.",
      "why_unsupported": "The user brief explicitly states not to treat market size or demand as confirmed facts. The web research indicates the existence of tutors and AI in education but does not quantify the market opportunity.",
